2. Step your feet back so your body is straight from head to heels.
3. Brace your core and squeeze your glutes.
4. Hold the position, breathing steadily, without letting your hips sag.', '["abs"]', '[]', '["bodyweight"]', 'beginner', 'active', 'plank', 'strength', 'core_anti_extension', 'time_hold', 'home', 'isolation', 'static', 'bilateral', 'Stop when form breaks rather than chasing time.', 'free_exercise_db', 'Plank', 'Plank', 'approve_with_flags', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Plank+exercise+form', 'fitbud_written', '{"licence":"FitBud proprietary (own wording)","author":"FitBud"}', 1, 'ai_authored:specific', 1, '["ai_authored_steps","no_drawing","no_image","steps_fitbud_written_trainer_review"]', 'library+csv', '2026.10.21-v3', COALESCE((SELECT `created_at` FROM `exercise_library_items` WHERE `id` = 'e1000001-0000-4000-8000-00000000001b'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO `exercise_library_items` (`id`, `ownership`, `trainer_user_id`, `name`, `name_norm`, `name_source`, `description`, `description_provenance`, `instructions`, `primary_muscles_json`, `secondary_muscles_json`, `equipment_json`, `difficulty`, `status`, `slug`, `category_code`, `movement_pattern_code`, `logging_type_code`, `setting`, `mechanic`, `force`, `laterality`, `safety_note`, `source_id`, `source_ref`, `source_name`, `review_status`, `youtube_search_url`, `steps_source`, `steps_licence_json`, `steps_review_required`, `coaching_provenance`, `needs_human_review`, `review_flags_json`, `origin`, `seed_version`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES ('e1000001-0000-4000-8000-00000000000b', 'global', NULL, 'Pull-up', 'pull-up', 'free_exercise_db', 'A compound strength exercise using a pull-up bar that mainly works the lats, with the biceps and upper back assisting.', 'ai_authored:facts_template', '1. Grab the pull-up bar with the palms facing forward using the prescribed grip. For a medium grip, your hands need to be spaced out at a distance equal to your shoulder width and for a close grip at a distance smaller than your shoulder width.
2. As you have both arms extended in front of you holding the bar at the chosen grip width, bring your torso back around 30 degrees or so while creating a curvature on your lower back and sticking your chest out. This is your starting position.
3. Pull your torso up until the bar touches your upper chest by drawing the shoulders and the upper arms down and back. Exhale as you perform this portion of the movement. The upper torso should remain stationary as it moves through space and only the arms should move. The forearms should do no other work other than hold the bar.
4. After a second on the contracted position, start to inhale and slowly lower your torso back to the starting position when your arms are fully extended and the lats are fully stretched.
5. Repeat this motion for the prescribed amount of repetitions.', '["lats"]', '["biceps","upper_back"]', '["pull_up_bar"]', 'beginner', 'active', 'pull-up', 'strength', 'vertical_pull', 'reps_bodyweight', 'gym', 'compound', 'pull', 'bilateral', 'Use assistance (band/machine) until you can do clean reps.', 'free_exercise_db', 'Pullups', 'Pullups', 'approve', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Pull-up+exercise+form', 'free_exercise_db', '{"licence":"Unlicense","licence_url":"https://unlicense.org/","source_url":"https://github.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db (exercises/Pullups.json)","author":"free-exercise-db contributors","modified":"split/merged into 3-6 ordered steps; non-instruction sentences removed"}', 0, 'ai_authored:specific', 0, '["no_alternative"]', 'library+csv', '2026.10.21-v3', COALESCE((SELECT `created_at` FROM `exercise_library_items` WHERE `id` = 'e1000001-0000-4000-8000-00000000000b'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO `exercise_library_items` (`id`, `ownership`, `trainer_user_id`, `name`, `name_norm`, `name_source`, `description`, `description_provenance`, `instructions`, `primary_muscles_json`, `secondary_muscles_json`, `equipment_json`, `difficulty`, `status`, `slug`, `category_code`, `movement_pattern_code`, `logging_type_code`, `setting`, `mechanic`, `force`, `laterality`, `safety_note`, `source_id`, `source_ref`, `source_name`, `review_status`, `youtube_search_url`, `steps_source`, `steps_licence_json`, `steps_review_required`, `coaching_provenance`, `needs_human_review`, `review_flags_json`, `origin`, `seed_version`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES ('e1000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000007', 'global', NULL, 'Push-up', 'push-up', 'free_exercise_db', 'A compound strength exercise using your bodyweight that mainly works the chest, with the front delts and triceps assisting.', 'ai_authored:facts_template', '1. Lie on the floor face down and place your hands slightly wider than shoulder-width apart while holding your torso up at arms length.
2. Next, lower yourself downward until your chest almost touches the floor as you inhale.
3. Now breathe out and press your upper body back up to the starting position while squeezing your chest.
4. After a brief pause at the top contracted position, you can begin to lower yourself downward again for as many repetitions as needed.', '["chest"]', '["front_delts","triceps"]', '["bodyweight"]', 'beginner', 'active', 'push-up', 'strength', 'horizontal_push', 'reps_bodyweight', 'home', 'compound', 'push', 'bilateral', 'Use a spotter or safety arms for heavy pressing.', 'free_exercise_db', 'Pushups', 'Pushups', 'approve', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Push-up+exercise+form', 'free_exercise_db', '{"licence":"Unlicense","licence_url":"https://unlicense.org/","source_url":"https://github.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db (exercises/Pushups.json)","author":"free-exercise-db contributors","modified":"split/merged into 3-6 ordered steps; non-instruction sentences removed; curated edit to pass step validation (curation/steps_source_fixes.tsv)"}', 0, 'ai_authored:specific', 0, '[]', 'library+csv', '2026.10.21-v3', COALESCE((SELECT `created_at` FROM `exercise_library_items` WHERE `id` = 'e1000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000007'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO `exercise_library_items` (`id`, `ownership`, `trainer_user_id`, `name`, `name_norm`, `name_source`, `description`, `description_provenance`, `instructions`, `primary_muscles_json`, `secondary_muscles_json`, `equipment_json`, `difficulty`, `status`, `slug`, `category_code`, `movement_pattern_code`, `logging_type_code`, `setting`, `mechanic`, `force`, `laterality`, `safety_note`, `source_id`, `source_ref`, `source_name`, `review_status`, `youtube_search_url`, `steps_source`, `steps_licence_json`, `steps_review_required`, `coaching_provenance`, `needs_human_review`, `review_flags_json`, `origin`, `seed_version`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES ('e1000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000003', 'global', NULL, 'Romanian Deadlift', 'romanian deadlift', 'free_exercise_db', 'A compound strength exercise using a barbell that mainly works the hamstrings, with the calves and glutes assisting.', 'ai_authored:facts_template', '1. Put a barbell in front of you on the ground and grab it using a pronated (palms facing down) grip that a little wider than shoulder width.
2. Bend the knees slightly and keep the shins vertical, hips back and back straight. This will be your starting position.
3. Keeping your back and arms completely straight at all times, use your hips to lift the bar as you exhale.
4. Once you are standing completely straight up, lower the bar by pushing the hips back, only slightly bending the knees, unlike when squatting. Hold your breath as you lower and exhale as you complete the movement.
5. Repeat for the recommended amount of repetitions.', '["hamstrings"]', '["calves","glutes","lower_back"]', '["barbell"]', 'intermediate', 'active', 'romanian-deadlift-barbell', 'strength', 'hinge', 'reps_weight', 'gym', 'compound', 'pull', 'bilateral', 'Start light; stop if you feel sharp lower-back pain.', 'free_exercise_db', 'Romanian_Deadlift', 'Romanian Deadlift', 'needs_human', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Romanian+Deadlift+exercise+form', 'free_exercise_db', '{"licence":"Unlicense","licence_url":"https://unlicense.org/","source_url":"https://github.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db (exercises/Romanian_Deadlift.json)","author":"free-exercise-db contributors","modified":"split/merged into 3-6 ordered steps; non-instruction sentences removed"}', 0, 'ai_authored:specific', 1, '["csv_disagrees"]', 'library+csv', '2026.10.21-v3', COALESCE((SELECT `created_at` FROM `exercise_library_items` WHERE `id` = 'e1000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000003'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z');
