2. Hold the cable handles with straight arms and sit tall with your chest up.
3. Pull the cable handles to your lower ribs, driving your elbows back.
4. Pause, then let your arms straighten slowly without rounding forward.', '["upper_back"]', '["biceps","lats","front_delts"]', '["cable"]', 'beginner', 'active', 'seated-cable-row', 'strength', 'horizontal_pull', 'reps_weight', 'gym', 'compound', 'pull', 'bilateral', 'Keep a neutral spine, especially in bent-over rows.', 'free_exercise_db', 'Seated_Cable_Rows', 'Seated Cable Rows', 'approve', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Seated+Cable+Row+exercise+form', 'fitbud_written', '{"licence":"FitBud proprietary (own wording)","author":"FitBud","replaces":"free_exercise_db"}', 1, 'ai_authored:specific', 1, '["steps_fitbud_written_trainer_review"]', 'library', '2026.10.21-v3', COALESCE((SELECT `created_at` FROM `exercise_library_items` WHERE `id` = 'e1000001-0000-4000-8000-00000000000d'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z');
