2. While maintaining the torso in a stationary position (no swinging), lift the dumbbells to your side with a slight bend on the elbow and the hands slightly tilted forward as if pouring water in a glass. Continue to go up until you arms are parallel to the floor. Exhale as you execute this movement and pause for a second at the top.
3. Lower the dumbbells back down slowly to the starting position as you inhale.
4. Repeat for the recommended amount of repetitions.', '["side_delts"]', '[]', '["dumbbell"]', 'beginner', 'active', 'side-lateral-raise', 'strength', 'shoulder_isolation', 'reps_weight', 'both', 'isolation', 'push', 'bilateral', 'Use light loads; these are accessory movements.', 'free_exercise_db', 'Side_Lateral_Raise', 'Side Lateral Raise', 'approve', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Side+Lateral+Raise+exercise+form', 'free_exercise_db', '{"licence":"Unlicense","licence_url":"https://unlicense.org/","source_url":"https://github.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db (exercises/Side_Lateral_Raise.json)","author":"free-exercise-db contributors","modified":"split/merged into 3-6 ordered steps; non-instruction sentences removed"}', 0, 'ai_authored:specific', 0, '[]', 'library', '2026.10.21-v3', COALESCE((SELECT `created_at` FROM `exercise_library_items` WHERE `id` = 'e1000001-0000-4000-8000-00000000000a'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z');
