2. Warm up for 3-5 minutes at an easy effort.
3. Build to your target effort and hold a steady rhythm.
4. Ease off for the last few minutes to cool down.', '["quads"]', '["calves","glutes","hamstrings"]', '["machine","stationary_bike"]', 'beginner', 'active', 'stationary-bike', 'cardio', 'locomotion', 'distance_time', 'cardio', 'compound', NULL, 'bilateral', 'Stop if you feel chest pain, dizziness or unusual breathlessness.', 'free_exercise_db', 'Bicycling_Stationary', 'Bicycling, Stationary', 'approve_with_flags', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Stationary+Bike+exercise+form', 'fitbud_written', '{"licence":"FitBud proprietary (own wording)","author":"FitBud"}', 1, 'ai_authored:specific', 1, '["ai_authored_steps","no_drawing","no_image","steps_fitbud_written_trainer_review"]', 'library', '2026.10.21-v3', COALESCE((SELECT `created_at` FROM `exercise_library_items` WHERE `id` = 'e1000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000024'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z');
