2. Grip the bar with your hands clearly wider than shoulder-width.
3. Pull the bar down to your upper chest, driving your elbows toward your ribs.
4. Let the bar rise slowly until your arms are straight.', '["lats"]', '["biceps","upper_back","front_delts"]', '["cable"]', 'beginner', 'active', 'lat-pulldown-wide-grip', 'strength', 'vertical_pull', 'reps_weight', 'gym', 'compound', 'pull', 'bilateral', 'Use assistance (band/machine) until you can do clean reps.', 'free_exercise_db', 'Wide-Grip_Lat_Pulldown', 'Wide-Grip Lat Pulldown', 'approve', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Wide-Grip+Lat+Pulldown+exercise+form', 'fitbud_written', '{"licence":"FitBud proprietary (own wording)","author":"FitBud","replaces":"free_exercise_db"}', 1, 'ai_authored:specific', 1, '["no_alternative","no_image","steps_fitbud_written_trainer_review"]', 'library+csv', '2026.10.21-v3', COALESCE((SELECT `created_at` FROM `exercise_library_items` WHERE `id` = 'e1000001-0000-4000-8000-00000000000c'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z');
