2. Hold the kettlebell with your arms straight below your shoulders.
3. Row the kettlebell toward your lower ribs, driving your elbows back.
4. Lower the kettlebell slowly to straight arms.
5. Alternate sides on every rep, keeping the same tempo on both sides.', '["upper_back"]', '["abs","biceps","chest","lats","triceps"]', '["kettlebell"]', 'advanced', 'active', 'alternating-renegade-row', 'strength', 'horizontal_pull', 'reps_weight', 'both', 'compound', 'pull', 'alternating', 'Keep a neutral spine, especially in bent-over rows.', 'free_exercise_db', 'Alternating_Renegade_Row', 'Alternating Renegade Row', 'approve', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Alternating+Renegade+Row+exercise+form', 'fitbud_written', '{"licence":"FitBud proprietary (own wording)","author":"FitBud","replaces":"free_exercise_db"}', 1, 'ai_authored:pattern', 1, '["generic_coaching","no_drawing","no_image","steps_fitbud_written_trainer_review"]', 'library', '2026.10.21-v3', COALESCE((SELECT `created_at` FROM `exercise_library_items` WHERE `id` = '4843fe76-be73-5f5e-8724-20efe7ac747a'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z');
