2. Build up to a brisk walking pace.
3. Stand tall with relaxed shoulders and let your arms swing naturally.
4. Ease down to a walk for a few minutes to cool down.
5. Keep alternating sides in a smooth, even rhythm.', '["quads","calves"]', '["glutes","hamstrings"]', '["bodyweight"]', 'beginner', 'active', 'brisk-walk-outdoor', 'cardio', 'locomotion', 'distance_time', 'cardio', 'compound', 'push', 'alternating', 'Stop if you feel chest pain, dizziness or unusual breathlessness.', 'fitbud', 'brisk_walk', 'Brisk walk (outdoor)', 'needs_human', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Brisk+Outdoor+Walk+exercise+form', 'fitbud_written', '{"licence":"FitBud proprietary (own wording)","author":"FitBud"}', 1, 'ai_authored:specific', 1, '["ai_authored_steps","no_drawing","no_image","steps_fitbud_written_trainer_review"]', 'library', '2026.10.21-v3', COALESCE((SELECT `created_at` FROM `exercise_library_items` WHERE `id` = '6d4c0104-26da-5b8a-994f-dd85e0115865'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z');
