2. Position the elbow against your side with the elbow bent at 90° and the arm pointing towards the pulley. This will be your starting position.
3. Pull the single hand cable attachment toward your body by internally rotating your shoulder until your forearm is across your abs. You will be creating an imaginary semi-circle.
4. Slowly go back to the initial position.
5. Repeat for the recommended amount of repetitions and then repeat the movement with the next arm.', '["front_delts"]', '[]', '["cable"]', 'beginner', 'active', 'cable-internal-rotation', 'strength', 'shoulder_isolation', 'reps_weight', 'gym', 'compound', 'pull', 'bilateral', 'Use light loads; these are accessory movements.', 'free_exercise_db', 'Cable_Internal_Rotation', 'Cable Internal Rotation', 'needs_human', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Cable+Internal+Rotation+exercise+form', 'free_exercise_db', '{"licence":"Unlicense","licence_url":"https://unlicense.org/","source_url":"https://github.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db (exercises/Cable_Internal_Rotation.json)","author":"free-exercise-db contributors","modified":"split/merged into 3-6 ordered steps; non-instruction sentences removed"}', 0, 'ai_authored:pattern', 1, '["csv_disagrees","generic_coaching"]', 'library+csv', '2026.10.21-v3', COALESCE((SELECT `created_at` FROM `exercise_library_items` WHERE `id` = '936553dd-4dbf-5189-a83b-86dd74d5ae2e'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z');
