2. Hold the EZ bar at shoulder height with your hands about shoulder-width apart or slightly closer.
3. Brace your core and press the EZ bar straight overhead until your arms are straight.
4. Lower the EZ bar under control back to shoulder height.', '["triceps"]', '["chest","front_delts"]', '["ez_bar"]', 'beginner', 'active', 'close-grip-ez-bar-press', 'strength', 'elbow_extension', 'reps_weight', 'gym', 'compound', 'push', 'bilateral', 'Reduce range if you feel elbow pain.', 'free_exercise_db', 'Close-Grip_EZ-Bar_Press', 'Close-Grip EZ-Bar Press', 'needs_human', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Close-Grip+EZ-Bar+Press+exercise+form', 'fitbud_written', '{"licence":"FitBud proprietary (own wording)","author":"FitBud","replaces":"free_exercise_db"}', 1, 'ai_authored:pattern', 1, '["csv_disagrees","generic_coaching","no_drawing","no_image","steps_fitbud_written_trainer_review"]', 'library+csv', '2026.10.21-v3', COALESCE((SELECT `created_at` FROM `exercise_library_items` WHERE `id` = '34e0ff98-254c-5c4a-bc4f-173058609bea'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z');
