2. Lower yourself until your chest almost touches the floor as you inhale.
3. Using your triceps and some of your pectoral muscles, press your upper body back up to the starting position and squeeze your chest. Breathe out as you perform this step.
4. After a second pause at the contracted position, repeat the movement for the prescribed amount of repetitions.', '["triceps"]', '["chest","front_delts"]', '["bodyweight"]', 'intermediate', 'active', 'push-ups-close-triceps-position', 'strength', 'horizontal_push', 'reps_bodyweight', 'home', 'compound', 'push', 'bilateral', 'Use a spotter or safety arms for heavy pressing.', 'free_exercise_db', 'Push-Ups_-_Close_Triceps_Position', 'Push-Ups - Close Triceps Position', 'needs_human', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Close-Grip+Push-up+exercise+form', 'free_exercise_db', '{"licence":"Unlicense","licence_url":"https://unlicense.org/","source_url":"https://github.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db (exercises/Push-Ups_-_Close_Triceps_Position.json)","author":"free-exercise-db contributors","modified":"split/merged into 3-6 ordered steps; non-instruction sentences removed"}', 0, 'ai_authored:pattern', 1, '["csv_disagrees","generic_coaching"]', 'library+csv', '2026.10.21-v3', COALESCE((SELECT `created_at` FROM `exercise_library_items` WHERE `id` = 'b7a53b46-7045-5c2b-8a1b-5b4c229a55c5'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z');
