2. Bend your elbow to 90 degrees and keep it tucked against your side.
3. Rotate your forearm out away from your body while your elbow stays fixed.
4. Return slowly, finish the set, then switch sides.', '["front_delts"]', '[]', '["cable"]', 'beginner', 'active', 'external-rotation-with-cable', 'strength', 'shoulder_isolation', 'reps_weight', 'gym', 'isolation', 'pull', 'bilateral', 'Use light loads; these are accessory movements.', 'free_exercise_db', 'External_Rotation_with_Cable', 'External Rotation with Cable', 'approve', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=External+Rotation+with+Cable+exercise+form', 'fitbud_written', '{"licence":"FitBud proprietary (own wording)","author":"FitBud","replaces":"free_exercise_db"}', 1, 'ai_authored:pattern', 1, '["generic_coaching","no_drawing","no_image","steps_fitbud_written_trainer_review"]', 'library+csv', '2026.10.21-v3', COALESCE((SELECT `created_at` FROM `exercise_library_items` WHERE `id` = 'd2c59682-1df1-5cb4-a43e-2ba7474e05bd'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z');
