2. Begin by aggressively extending through the hips, knees and ankles, driving the weight upward. As you do so, shrug your shoulders towards your ears.
3. Immediately recover by driving through the heels, keeping the torso upright and elbows up. Continue until you have risen to a standing position.', '["quads"]', '["calves","forearms","glutes","hamstrings","lower_back","front_delts","traps"]', '["barbell"]', 'advanced', 'active', 'hang-clean', 'power', 'power', 'time_hold', 'gym', 'compound', 'pull', 'bilateral', 'Learn with a coach and light loads; power moves are technique-first.', 'free_exercise_db', 'Hang_Clean', 'Hang Clean', 'needs_human', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Hang+Clean+exercise+form', 'free_exercise_db', '{"licence":"Unlicense","licence_url":"https://unlicense.org/","source_url":"https://github.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db (exercises/Hang_Clean.json)","author":"free-exercise-db contributors","modified":"split/merged into 3-6 ordered steps; non-instruction sentences removed"}', 0, 'ai_authored:pattern', 1, '["csv_disagrees","generic_coaching","no_alternative","no_drawing","no_image","no_relations"]', 'library+csv', '2026.10.21-v3', COALESCE((SELECT `created_at` FROM `exercise_library_items` WHERE `id` = '1bc400a6-698d-537a-a2e6-1250e71092b0'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z');
