2. Raise your legs until the torso makes a 90-degree angle with the legs. Exhale as you perform this movement and hold the contraction for a second or so.
3. Go back slowly to the starting position as you breathe in.
4. Repeat for the recommended amount of repetitions.', '["abs"]', '[]', '["pull_up_bar"]', 'advanced', 'active', 'hanging-leg-raise', 'strength', 'core_flexion', 'reps_bodyweight', 'gym', 'isolation', 'pull', 'bilateral', 'Skip or modify if it aggravates lower-back pain.', 'free_exercise_db', 'Hanging_Leg_Raise', 'Hanging Leg Raise', 'approve', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Hanging+Leg+Raise+exercise+form', 'free_exercise_db', '{"licence":"Unlicense","licence_url":"https://unlicense.org/","source_url":"https://github.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db (exercises/Hanging_Leg_Raise.json)","author":"free-exercise-db contributors","modified":"split/merged into 3-6 ordered steps; non-instruction sentences removed"}', 0, 'ai_authored:pattern', 1, '["generic_coaching","media_variant_drawing","no_image"]', 'library+csv', '2026.10.21-v3', COALESCE((SELECT `created_at` FROM `exercise_library_items` WHERE `id` = '7a846251-b673-5cd2-a4c2-0bdf5c8d88c2'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z');
