2. Curl the handles towards you until they are next to your ears. Make sure that as you do so you flex your biceps and exhale. The upper arms should remain stationary and only the forearms should move. Hold for a second in the contracted position as you squeeze the biceps.
3. Slowly bring back the arms to the starting position.
4. Repeat for the recommended amount of repetitions.', '["biceps"]', '[]', '["cable"]', 'intermediate', 'active', 'high-cable-curls', 'strength', 'elbow_flexion', 'reps_weight', 'gym', 'compound', 'pull', 'bilateral', 'Use a load you can control for the whole set.', 'free_exercise_db', 'High_Cable_Curls', 'High Cable Curls', 'approve', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=High+Cable+Curl+exercise+form', 'free_exercise_db', '{"licence":"Unlicense","licence_url":"https://unlicense.org/","source_url":"https://github.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db (exercises/High_Cable_Curls.json)","author":"free-exercise-db contributors","modified":"split/merged into 3-6 ordered steps; non-instruction sentences removed"}', 0, 'ai_authored:pattern', 0, '["generic_coaching"]', 'library', '2026.10.21-v3', COALESCE((SELECT `created_at` FROM `exercise_library_items` WHERE `id` = '81784b4f-4280-58ce-9ccc-8b18139e372a'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z');
