2. Now place the barbell on the floor in front of you so that you are on all your hands and knees (as in a kneeling push up position). This will be your starting position.
3. Slowly roll the barbell straight forward, stretching your body into a straight position. Breathe in during this portion of the movement.
4. After a second pause at the stretched position, start pulling yourself back to the starting position as you breathe out.', '["abs"]', '["lower_back","front_delts"]', '["barbell"]', 'advanced', 'active', 'barbell-ab-rollout-on-knees', 'strength', 'core_anti_extension', 'reps_weight', 'gym', 'compound', 'pull', 'bilateral', 'Stop when form breaks rather than chasing time.', 'free_exercise_db', 'Barbell_Ab_Rollout_-_On_Knees', 'Barbell Ab Rollout - On Knees', 'approve', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Kneeling+Barbell+Ab+Rollout+exercise+form', 'free_exercise_db', '{"licence":"Unlicense","licence_url":"https://unlicense.org/","source_url":"https://github.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db (exercises/Barbell_Ab_Rollout_-_On_Knees.json)","author":"free-exercise-db contributors","modified":"split/merged into 3-6 ordered steps; non-instruction sentences removed"}', 0, 'ai_authored:pattern', 0, '["generic_coaching"]', 'library', '2026.10.21-v3', COALESCE((SELECT `created_at` FROM `exercise_library_items` WHERE `id` = 'e9e1fea8-796c-5ef5-ab69-813e77c771ee'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z');
