2. Begin facing your partner holding the medicine ball at your torso with both hands.
3. Pull the ball to your chest, and reverse the motion by extending through the elbows. For sports applications, you can take a step as you throw.
4. Your partner should catch the ball, and throw it back to you.
5. Receive the throw with both hands at chest height.', '["chest"]', '["front_delts","triceps"]', '["medicine_ball"]', 'beginner', 'active', 'medicine-ball-chest-pass', 'plyometric', 'power', 'reps_weight', 'gym', 'compound', 'push', 'bilateral', 'Learn with a coach and light loads; power moves are technique-first.', 'free_exercise_db', 'Medicine_Ball_Chest_Pass', 'Medicine Ball Chest Pass', 'approve_with_flags', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Medicine+Ball+Chest+Pass+exercise+form', 'free_exercise_db', '{"licence":"Unlicense","licence_url":"https://unlicense.org/","source_url":"https://github.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db (exercises/Medicine_Ball_Chest_Pass.json)","author":"free-exercise-db contributors","modified":"split/merged into 3-6 ordered steps; non-instruction sentences removed; curated edit to pass step validation (curation/steps_source_fixes.tsv)"}', 0, 'ai_authored:pattern', 1, '["generic_coaching","no_alternative","no_drawing","no_image","no_relations"]', 'library', '2026.10.21-v3', COALESCE((SELECT `created_at` FROM `exercise_library_items` WHERE `id` = 'd52984d3-ed7e-5308-97f8-5594d7afa0f2'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z');
