2. Now start to pull yourself up as you exhale. The elbow of that arm should remain close to the torso. With the other arm that has the palms facing forward, the elbows will be away but in line with the torso. You will concentrate on using the lats to pull your body up.
3. After a second contraction at the top, start to slowly come down as you inhale.
4. Repeat for the recommended amount of repetitions.
5. On the following set, switch grips; so if you had the right hand with the palms facing you and the left one with the palms facing forward, on the next set you will have the palms facing forward for the right hand and facing you for the left.', '["upper_back"]', '["biceps","lats"]', '["other"]', 'advanced', 'active', 'mixed-grip-chin-up', 'strength', 'vertical_pull', 'reps_weight', 'gym', 'compound', 'pull', 'bilateral', 'Use assistance (band/machine) until you can do clean reps.', 'free_exercise_db', 'Mixed_Grip_Chin', 'Mixed Grip Chin', 'needs_human', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Mixed-Grip+Chin+exercise+form', 'free_exercise_db', '{"licence":"Unlicense","licence_url":"https://unlicense.org/","source_url":"https://github.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db (exercises/Mixed_Grip_Chin.json)","author":"free-exercise-db contributors","modified":"split/merged into 3-6 ordered steps; non-instruction sentences removed"}', 0, 'ai_authored:pattern', 1, '["csv_disagrees","generic_coaching","media_variant_drawing","no_alternative","no_image","no_relations"]', 'library+csv', '2026.10.21-v3', COALESCE((SELECT `created_at` FROM `exercise_library_items` WHERE `id` = '63cba2c8-d3aa-56de-ba09-7bc7881c0a93'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z');
