2. Let your arms hang with a slight bend in your elbows.
3. Raise your arms to shoulder height with control.
4. Pause briefly, then lower your arms slowly to the start.', '["hamstrings"]', '["calves","glutes","lower_back"]', '["bodyweight"]', 'intermediate', 'active', 'natural-glute-ham-raise', 'strength', 'hinge', 'reps_bodyweight', 'home', 'compound', 'pull', 'bilateral', 'Start light; stop if you feel sharp lower-back pain.', 'free_exercise_db', 'Natural_Glute_Ham_Raise', 'Natural Glute Ham Raise', 'approve', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Natural+Glute+Ham+Raise+exercise+form', 'fitbud_written', '{"licence":"FitBud proprietary (own wording)","author":"FitBud","replaces":"free_exercise_db"}', 1, 'ai_authored:pattern', 1, '["generic_coaching","no_drawing","no_image","steps_fitbud_written_trainer_review"]', 'library', '2026.10.21-v3', COALESCE((SELECT `created_at` FROM `exercise_library_items` WHERE `id` = 'a60b6a32-2880-5c04-8f37-23e7a01c0d35'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z');
