2. Kneel down on both of your knees so that your body is facing the flat bench.
3. Use your arms to grab the barbell with a pronated grip (palms down) and bring them up so that your forearms are resting against the flat bench. Your wrists should be hanging over the edge. Start out by curling your wrist upwards and exhaling.
4. Slowly lower your wrists back down to the starting position while inhaling.
5. Repeat for the recommended amount of repetitions.', '["forearms"]', '[]', '["barbell","bench"]', 'beginner', 'active', 'palms-down-wrist-curl-over-a-bench', 'strength', 'forearm_grip', 'reps_weight', 'gym', 'isolation', 'pull', 'bilateral', 'Stop if you feel wrist pain.', 'free_exercise_db', 'Palms-Down_Wrist_Curl_Over_A_Bench', 'Palms-Down Wrist Curl Over A Bench', 'approve', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Palms-Down+Wrist+Curl+over+a+Bench+exercise+form', 'free_exercise_db', '{"licence":"Unlicense","licence_url":"https://unlicense.org/","source_url":"https://github.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db (exercises/Palms-Down_Wrist_Curl_Over_A_Bench.json)","author":"free-exercise-db contributors","modified":"split/merged into 3-6 ordered steps; non-instruction sentences removed; curated edit to pass step validation (curation/steps_source_fixes.tsv)"}', 0, 'ai_authored:pattern', 0, '["generic_coaching","no_alternative","no_drawing","no_image"]', 'library', '2026.10.21-v3', COALESCE((SELECT `created_at` FROM `exercise_library_items` WHERE `id` = '4fef3008-7805-5e33-a37c-542980e194a4'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z');
