2. Bend your elbows to lower the top of your head toward the floor between your hands.
3. Press back up to straight arms, keeping your hips high.
4. Keep your neck neutral and stop short of touching your head on the floor.', '["front_delts"]', '["triceps","upper_back"]', '["bodyweight"]', 'intermediate', 'active', 'pike-push-up', 'strength', 'vertical_push', 'reps_bodyweight', 'home', 'compound', 'push', 'bilateral', 'Avoid if overhead pressing causes shoulder pain; use a landmine press instead.', 'fitbud', 'pike_push_up', 'Pike push-up', 'needs_human', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Pike+Push-up+exercise+form', 'fitbud_written', '{"licence":"FitBud proprietary (own wording)","author":"FitBud"}', 1, 'ai_authored:specific', 1, '["ai_authored_steps","media_variant_drawing","no_image","steps_fitbud_written_trainer_review"]', 'library', '2026.10.21-v3', COALESCE((SELECT `created_at` FROM `exercise_library_items` WHERE `id` = '33763122-6876-54a3-88cf-2878e0e4c334'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z');
