2. Perform a pushup by allowing the elbows to flex. As you descend, keep your body straight.
3. Do one pushup and as you come up, shift your weight on the left side of the body, twist to the side while bringing the right arm up towards the ceiling in a side plank.
4. Lower the arm back to the floor for another pushup and then twist to the other side.
5. Repeat the series, alternating each side, for 10 or more reps.', '["chest"]', '["abs","front_delts","triceps"]', '["bodyweight"]', 'beginner', 'active', 'push-up-to-side-plank', 'strength', 'horizontal_push', 'time_hold', 'home', 'compound', 'push', 'bilateral', 'Use a spotter or safety arms for heavy pressing.', 'free_exercise_db', 'Push_Up_to_Side_Plank', 'Push Up to Side Plank', 'needs_human', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Push-up+to+Side+Plank+exercise+form', 'free_exercise_db', '{"licence":"Unlicense","licence_url":"https://unlicense.org/","source_url":"https://github.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db (exercises/Push_Up_to_Side_Plank.json)","author":"free-exercise-db contributors","modified":"split/merged into 3-6 ordered steps; non-instruction sentences removed"}', 0, 'ai_authored:pattern', 1, '["csv_disagrees","generic_coaching","no_drawing","no_image"]', 'library+csv', '2026.10.21-v3', COALESCE((SELECT `created_at` FROM `exercise_library_items` WHERE `id` = 'b6d28e60-640c-5dec-b895-96f7bff2d858'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO `exercise_library_items` (`id`, `ownership`, `trainer_user_id`, `name`, `name_norm`, `name_source`, `description`, `description_provenance`, `instructions`, `primary_muscles_json`, `secondary_muscles_json`, `equipment_json`, `difficulty`, `status`, `slug`, `category_code`, `movement_pattern_code`, `logging_type_code`, `setting`, `mechanic`, `force`, `laterality`, `safety_note`, `source_id`, `source_ref`, `source_name`, `review_status`, `youtube_search_url`, `steps_source`, `steps_licence_json`, `steps_review_required`, `coaching_provenance`, `needs_human_review`, `review_flags_json`, `origin`, `seed_version`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES ('33229a53-5604-5a22-a125-eddbf4185254', 'global', NULL, 'Quad Stretch', 'quad stretch', 'free_exercise_db', 'A mobility exercise using your bodyweight that mainly works the quads.', 'ai_authored:facts_template', '1. Stand tall holding a support with one hand.
2. Bend one knee and hold that ankle behind you, drawing your heel toward your glutes with your knees together.
3. Stop at a gentle stretch in your quads and hold for 20-30 seconds, breathing slowly.
4. Release, then switch sides.', '["quads"]', '[]', '["other"]', 'intermediate', 'active', 'quad-stretch', 'mobility', 'mobility', 'time_hold', 'mobility', 'isolation', 'static', 'bilateral', 'Mild tension is fine; sharp pain is not.', 'free_exercise_db', 'Quad_Stretch', 'Quad Stretch', 'approve_with_flags', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Quad+Stretch+exercise+form', 'fitbud_written', '{"licence":"FitBud proprietary (own wording)","author":"FitBud","replaces":"free_exercise_db"}', 1, 'ai_authored:pattern', 1, '["few_steps","generic_coaching","no_drawing","no_image","steps_fitbud_written_trainer_review"]', 'library', '2026.10.21-v3', COALESCE((SELECT `created_at` FROM `exercise_library_items` WHERE `id` = '33229a53-5604-5a22-a125-eddbf4185254'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO `exercise_library_items` (`id`, `ownership`, `trainer_user_id`, `name`, `name_norm`, `name_source`, `description`, `description_provenance`, `instructions`, `primary_muscles_json`, `secondary_muscles_json`, `equipment_json`, `difficulty`, `status`, `slug`, `category_code`, `movement_pattern_code`, `logging_type_code`, `setting`, `mechanic`, `force`, `laterality`, `safety_note`, `source_id`, `source_ref`, `source_name`, `review_status`, `youtube_search_url`, `steps_source`, `steps_licence_json`, `steps_review_required`, `coaching_provenance`, `needs_human_review`, `review_flags_json`, `origin`, `seed_version`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES ('a1440eac-5255-557f-afed-c72120466dcf', 'global', NULL, 'Quadriceps-SMR', 'quadriceps-smr', 'free_exercise_db', 'A mobility exercise using a foam roller that mainly works the quads.', 'ai_authored:facts_template', '1. Lay facedown on the floor with your weight supported by your hands or forearms.
2. Place a foam roll underneath one leg on the quadriceps, and keep the foot off of the ground.
3. Make sure to relax the leg as much as possible.
4. This will be your starting position.
5. Shifting as much weight onto the leg to be stretched as is tolerable, roll over the foam from above the knee to below the hip, holding points of tension for 10-30 seconds.
6. Switch sides.', '["quads"]', '[]', '["foam_roller"]', 'intermediate', 'active', 'quadriceps-foam-roll', 'mobility', 'mobility', 'time_hold', 'mobility', 'isolation', 'static', 'bilateral', 'Mild tension is fine; sharp pain is not.', 'free_exercise_db', 'Quadriceps-SMR', 'Quadriceps-SMR', 'approve_with_flags', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Quadriceps-SMR+exercise+form', 'free_exercise_db', '{"licence":"Unlicense","licence_url":"https://unlicense.org/","source_url":"https://github.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db (exercises/Quadriceps-SMR.json)","author":"free-exercise-db contributors","modified":"split/merged into 3-6 ordered steps; non-instruction sentences removed"}', 0, 'ai_authored:pattern', 1, '["few_steps","generic_coaching","no_drawing","no_image"]', 'library', '2026.10.21-v3', COALESCE((SELECT `created_at` FROM `exercise_library_items` WHERE `id` = 'a1440eac-5255-557f-afed-c72120466dcf'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO `exercise_library_items` (`id`, `ownership`, `trainer_user_id`, `name`, `name_norm`, `name_source`, `description`, `description_provenance`, `instructions`, `primary_muscles_json`, `secondary_muscles_json`, `equipment_json`, `difficulty`, `status`, `slug`, `category_code`, `movement_pattern_code`, `logging_type_code`, `setting`, `mechanic`, `force`, `laterality`, `safety_note`, `source_id`, `source_ref`, `source_name`, `review_status`, `youtube_search_url`, `steps_source`, `steps_licence_json`, `steps_review_required`, `coaching_provenance`, `needs_human_review`, `review_flags_json`, `origin`, `seed_version`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES ('c22590ae-306d-52b6-84d1-aaa938e6b584', 'global', NULL, 'Rack Pull', 'rack pull', 'free_exercise_db', 'A compound strength exercise using a barbell that mainly works the lower back, with the forearms and glutes assisting.', 'ai_authored:facts_template', '1. Set up in a power rack with the bar on the pins. The pins should be set to the desired point; just below the knees, just above, or in the mid thigh position. Position yourself against the bar in proper deadlifting position. Your feet should be under your hips, your grip shoulder width, back arched, and hips back to engage the hamstrings. Since the weight is typically heavy, you may use a mixed grip, a hook grip, or use straps to aid in holding the weight.
2. With your head looking forward, extend through the hips and knees, pulling the weight up and back until lockout. Be sure to pull your shoulders back as you complete the movement.
3. Return the weight to the pins and repeat.', '["lower_back"]', '["forearms","glutes","hamstrings","traps"]', '["barbell"]', 'intermediate', 'active', 'rack-pulls', 'strength', 'hinge', 'reps_weight', 'gym', 'compound', 'pull', 'bilateral', 'Start light; stop if you feel sharp lower-back pain.', 'free_exercise_db', 'Rack_Pulls', 'Rack Pulls', 'approve', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Rack+Pull+exercise+form', 'free_exercise_db', '{"licence":"Unlicense","licence_url":"https://unlicense.org/","source_url":"https://github.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db (exercises/Rack_Pulls.json)","author":"free-exercise-db contributors","modified":"split/merged into 3-6 ordered steps; non-instruction sentences removed"}', 0, 'ai_authored:pattern', 0, '["generic_coaching","long_step","no_drawing","no_image"]', 'library', '2026.10.21-v3', COALESCE((SELECT `created_at` FROM `exercise_library_items` WHERE `id` = 'c22590ae-306d-52b6-84d1-aaa938e6b584'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z');
