2. Raise your arms out to the sides with a slight bend in your elbows, pulling your shoulder blades together.
3. Pause when your arms are level with your body.
4. Lower slowly back to the start.', '["rear_delts"]', '[]', '["dumbbell"]', 'beginner', 'active', 'reverse-fly', 'strength', 'shoulder_isolation', 'reps_weight', 'both', 'isolation', 'pull', 'bilateral', 'Use light loads; these are accessory movements.', 'free_exercise_db', 'Reverse_Flyes', 'Reverse Flyes', 'approve', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Reverse+Fly+exercise+form', 'fitbud_written', '{"licence":"FitBud proprietary (own wording)","author":"FitBud","replaces":"free_exercise_db"}', 1, 'ai_authored:pattern', 1, '["generic_coaching","no_drawing","no_image","steps_fitbud_written_trainer_review"]', 'library', '2026.10.21-v3', COALESCE((SELECT `created_at` FROM `exercise_library_items` WHERE `id` = '227316cd-426b-5669-9a07-2585812674aa'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z');
