2. Stand tall with your elbows tucked against your sides.
3. Push the cable handles down until your arms are fully straight.
4. Let the cable handles rise slowly until your forearms are just above parallel to the floor.', '["triceps"]', '[]', '["cable"]', 'beginner', 'active', 'reverse-grip-triceps-pushdown', 'strength', 'elbow_extension', 'reps_weight', 'gym', 'isolation', 'push', 'bilateral', 'Reduce range if you feel elbow pain.', 'free_exercise_db', 'Reverse_Grip_Triceps_Pushdown', 'Reverse Grip Triceps Pushdown', 'approve', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Reverse-Grip+Triceps+Pushdown+exercise+form', 'fitbud_written', '{"licence":"FitBud proprietary (own wording)","author":"FitBud","replaces":"free_exercise_db"}', 1, 'ai_authored:pattern', 1, '["generic_coaching","steps_fitbud_written_trainer_review"]', 'library', '2026.10.21-v3', COALESCE((SELECT `created_at` FROM `exercise_library_items` WHERE `id` = 'f9d9b3a9-bd3b-592b-8f58-cbd9c3b0bee2'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z');
