2. Set the pulley at the lowest position and hold the rope attachment with your palms facing each other.
3. Curl the rope attachment toward your shoulders, keeping your elbows by your sides.
4. Lower the rope attachment slowly until your arms are straight.', '["biceps"]', '[]', '["cable"]', 'beginner', 'active', 'cable-hammer-curls-rope-attachment', 'strength', 'elbow_flexion', 'reps_weight', 'gym', 'isolation', 'pull', 'bilateral', 'Use a load you can control for the whole set.', 'free_exercise_db', 'Cable_Hammer_Curls_-_Rope_Attachment', 'Cable Hammer Curls - Rope Attachment', 'approve', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Rope+Cable+Hammer+Curl+exercise+form', 'fitbud_written', '{"licence":"FitBud proprietary (own wording)","author":"FitBud","replaces":"free_exercise_db"}', 1, 'ai_authored:pattern', 1, '["generic_coaching","steps_fitbud_written_trainer_review"]', 'library', '2026.10.21-v3', COALESCE((SELECT `created_at` FROM `exercise_library_items` WHERE `id` = '765954f7-289a-5015-9841-bf50127faf5c'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z');
