2. Hold the dumbbell in one hand with your arms straight.
3. Curl the dumbbell toward your shoulders, keeping your elbows still.
4. Squeeze your biceps at the top.
5. Lower the dumbbell slowly until your arms are straight.
6. Finish all reps on one side, then switch sides and repeat.', '["biceps"]', '[]', '["dumbbell","bench"]', 'beginner', 'active', 'one-arm-dumbbell-preacher-curl', 'strength', 'elbow_flexion', 'reps_weight', 'both', 'isolation', 'pull', 'unilateral', 'Use a load you can control for the whole set.', 'free_exercise_db', 'One_Arm_Dumbbell_Preacher_Curl', 'One Arm Dumbbell Preacher Curl', 'approve', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Single-Arm+Dumbbell+Preacher+Curl+exercise+form', 'fitbud_written', '{"licence":"FitBud proprietary (own wording)","author":"FitBud","replaces":"free_exercise_db"}', 1, 'ai_authored:pattern', 1, '["generic_coaching","steps_fitbud_written_trainer_review"]', 'library+csv', '2026.10.21-v3', COALESCE((SELECT `created_at` FROM `exercise_library_items` WHERE `id` = 'f5fecffa-50e5-500c-9dae-183adb08aea1'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z');
