2. Hold the kettlebell with your arms straight below your shoulders.
3. Row the kettlebell toward your lower ribs, driving your elbows back.
4. Lower the kettlebell slowly to straight arms.
5. Finish all reps on one side, then switch sides and repeat.', '["upper_back"]', '["biceps","lats"]', '["kettlebell"]', 'intermediate', 'active', 'one-arm-kettlebell-row', 'strength', 'horizontal_pull', 'reps_weight', 'both', 'compound', 'pull', 'unilateral', 'Keep a neutral spine, especially in bent-over rows.', 'free_exercise_db', 'One-Arm_Kettlebell_Row', 'One-Arm Kettlebell Row', 'approve_with_flags', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Single-Arm+Kettlebell+Row+exercise+form', 'fitbud_written', '{"licence":"FitBud proprietary (own wording)","author":"FitBud"}', 1, 'ai_authored:pattern', 1, '["ai_authored_steps","generic_coaching","no_drawing","no_image","steps_fitbud_written_trainer_review"]', 'library', '2026.10.21-v3', COALESCE((SELECT `created_at` FROM `exercise_library_items` WHERE `id` = '83881218-01d2-5741-a9cd-4914c6c17ee0'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z');
