3. Pause with your lat squeezed.
4. Let your arm straighten slowly overhead.
5. Finish all reps on one side, then switch sides and repeat.', '["lats"]', '["biceps","upper_back"]', '["cable"]', 'beginner', 'active', 'one-arm-lat-pulldown', 'strength', 'vertical_pull', 'reps_weight', 'gym', 'compound', 'pull', 'unilateral', 'Use assistance (band/machine) until you can do clean reps.', 'free_exercise_db', 'One_Arm_Lat_Pulldown', 'One Arm Lat Pulldown', 'approve', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Single-Arm+Lat+Pulldown+exercise+form', 'fitbud_written', '{"licence":"FitBud proprietary (own wording)","author":"FitBud","replaces":"free_exercise_db"}', 1, 'ai_authored:pattern', 1, '["generic_coaching","no_alternative","no_drawing","no_image","steps_fitbud_written_trainer_review"]', 'library', '2026.10.21-v3', COALESCE((SELECT `created_at` FROM `exercise_library_items` WHERE `id` = '45dca996-f226-5c11-a621-a4dba82b2099'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z');
