2. Raise one leg off of the ground, pulling the knee to your chest. This will be your starting position.
3. Execute the movement by driving through the heel, extending your hip upward and raising your glutes off of the ground.
4. Extend as far as possible, pause and then return to the starting position.
5. Finish all reps on one side, then switch sides and repeat.', '["glutes"]', '["hamstrings"]', '["bodyweight"]', 'beginner', 'active', 'single-leg-glute-bridge', 'strength', 'hinge', 'reps_bodyweight', 'home', 'isolation', 'push', 'unilateral', 'Start light; stop if you feel sharp lower-back pain.', 'free_exercise_db', 'Single_Leg_Glute_Bridge', 'Single Leg Glute Bridge', 'approve', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Single-Leg+Glute+Bridge+exercise+form', 'free_exercise_db', '{"licence":"Unlicense","licence_url":"https://unlicense.org/","source_url":"https://github.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db (exercises/Single_Leg_Glute_Bridge.json)","author":"free-exercise-db contributors","modified":"split/merged into 3-6 ordered steps; non-instruction sentences removed; curated edit to pass step validation (curation/steps_source_fixes.tsv)"}', 0, 'ai_authored:pattern', 0, '["generic_coaching","no_drawing","no_image"]', 'library+csv', '2026.10.21-v3', COALESCE((SELECT `created_at` FROM `exercise_library_items` WHERE `id` = '2f428dd7-90ba-5e0f-a46a-200556017e3e'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z');
