2. Maintaining good posture, fully extend one leg, pausing at the top of the motion.
3. Return to the starting position without letting the weight stop, keeping tension on the muscle.
4. Repeat for the desired number of repetitions.
5. Finish all reps on one side, then switch sides and repeat.', '["quads"]', '[]', '["machine"]', 'beginner', 'active', 'single-leg-leg-extension', 'strength', 'knee_extension', 'reps_weight', 'gym', 'isolation', 'push', 'unilateral', 'Adjust the pad to sit just above the ankle.', 'free_exercise_db', 'Single-Leg_Leg_Extension', 'Single-Leg Leg Extension', 'approve_with_flags', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Single-Leg+Leg+Extension+exercise+form', 'free_exercise_db', '{"licence":"Unlicense","licence_url":"https://unlicense.org/","source_url":"https://github.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db (exercises/Single-Leg_Leg_Extension.json)","author":"free-exercise-db contributors","modified":"split/merged into 3-6 ordered steps; non-instruction sentences removed; curated edit to pass step validation (curation/steps_source_fixes.tsv)"}', 0, 'ai_authored:pattern', 1, '["generic_coaching","no_alternative","no_relations"]', 'library+csv', '2026.10.21-v3', COALESCE((SELECT `created_at` FROM `exercise_library_items` WHERE `id` = 'ddb18f4b-713b-52a2-88a1-32122ee1f0fc'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z');
