2. Cross your arms over your chest.
3. Curl your torso up until you are sitting tall.
4. Lower back down slowly one vertebra at a time.', '["abs"]', '[]', '["bodyweight"]', 'beginner', 'active', 'sit-up', 'strength', 'core_flexion', 'reps_bodyweight', 'home', 'isolation', 'pull', 'bilateral', 'Skip or modify if it aggravates lower-back pain.', 'free_exercise_db', 'Sit-Up', 'Sit-Up', 'approve', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Sit-up+exercise+form', 'fitbud_written', '{"licence":"FitBud proprietary (own wording)","author":"FitBud","replaces":"free_exercise_db"}', 1, 'ai_authored:pattern', 1, '["generic_coaching","no_drawing","no_image","steps_fitbud_written_trainer_review"]', 'library+csv', '2026.10.21-v3', COALESCE((SELECT `created_at` FROM `exercise_library_items` WHERE `id` = '36dcd5d7-ad5b-5fdc-adb8-fbba8587ed47'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO `exercise_library_items` (`id`, `ownership`, `trainer_user_id`, `name`, `name_norm`, `name_source`, `description`, `description_provenance`, `instructions`, `primary_muscles_json`, `secondary_muscles_json`, `equipment_json`, `difficulty`, `status`, `slug`, `category_code`, `movement_pattern_code`, `logging_type_code`, `setting`, `mechanic`, `force`, `laterality`, `safety_note`, `source_id`, `source_ref`, `source_name`, `review_status`, `youtube_search_url`, `steps_source`, `steps_licence_json`, `steps_review_required`, `coaching_provenance`, `needs_human_review`, `review_flags_json`, `origin`, `seed_version`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES ('9938827a-fe76-543a-9ef5-46a1436a3864', 'global', NULL, 'Sled Push', 'sled push', 'free_exercise_db', 'A compound strength exercise using your bodyweight that mainly works the quads, with the calves and chest assisting.', 'ai_authored:facts_template', '1. Load your pushing sled with the desired weight.
2. Take an athletic posture, leaning into the sled with your arms fully extended, grasping the handles.
3. Push the sled as fast as possible, focusing on extending your hips and knees to strengthen your posterior chain.', '["quads"]', '["calves","chest","glutes","hamstrings","triceps"]', '["other"]', 'beginner', 'active', 'sled-push', 'strength', 'power', 'reps_weight', 'gym', 'compound', 'push', 'bilateral', 'Learn with a coach and light loads; power moves are technique-first.', 'free_exercise_db', 'Sled_Push', 'Sled Push', 'approve_with_flags', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Sled+Push+exercise+form', 'free_exercise_db', '{"licence":"Unlicense","licence_url":"https://unlicense.org/","source_url":"https://github.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db (exercises/Sled_Push.json)","author":"free-exercise-db contributors","modified":"split/merged into 3-6 ordered steps; non-instruction sentences removed"}', 0, 'ai_authored:pattern', 1, '["few_steps","generic_coaching","no_alternative","no_drawing","no_image","no_relations"]', 'library+csv', '2026.10.21-v3', COALESCE((SELECT `created_at` FROM `exercise_library_items` WHERE `id` = '9938827a-fe76-543a-9ef5-46a1436a3864'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO `exercise_library_items` (`id`, `ownership`, `trainer_user_id`, `name`, `name_norm`, `name_source`, `description`, `description_provenance`, `instructions`, `primary_muscles_json`, `secondary_muscles_json`, `equipment_json`, `difficulty`, `status`, `slug`, `category_code`, `movement_pattern_code`, `logging_type_code`, `setting`, `mechanic`, `force`, `laterality`, `safety_note`, `source_id`, `source_ref`, `source_name`, `review_status`, `youtube_search_url`, `steps_source`, `steps_licence_json`, `steps_review_required`, `coaching_provenance`, `needs_human_review`, `review_flags_json`, `origin`, `seed_version`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES ('6ef5b34f-8fc4-55b8-b9ec-b99b2282639e', 'global', NULL, 'Smith Machine Bench Press', 'smith machine bench press', 'free_exercise_db', 'A compound strength exercise using the machine and a Smith machine that mainly works the chest, with the front delts and triceps assisting.', 'ai_authored:facts_template', '1. Place a flat bench underneath the smith machine. Now place the barbell at a height that you can reach when lying down and your arms are almost fully extended. Once the weight you need is selected, lie down on the flat bench. Using a pronated grip that is wider than shoulder width, unlock the bar from the rack and hold it straight over you with your arms locked. This will be your starting position.
2. As you breathe in, come down slowly until you feel the bar on your middle chest.
3. After a second pause, bring the bar back to the starting position as you breathe out and push the bar using your chest muscles. Lock your arms in the contracted position, hold for a second and then start coming down slowly again.
4. Repeat the movement for the prescribed amount of repetitions.
5. When you are done, lock the bar back in the rack.', '["chest"]', '["front_delts","triceps"]', '["machine","bench","smith_machine"]', 'beginner', 'active', 'smith-machine-bench-press', 'strength', 'horizontal_push', 'reps_weight', 'gym', 'compound', 'push', 'bilateral', 'Use a spotter or safety arms for heavy pressing.', 'free_exercise_db', 'Smith_Machine_Bench_Press', 'Smith Machine Bench Press', 'approve', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Smith+Machine+Bench+Press+exercise+form', 'free_exercise_db', '{"licence":"Unlicense","licence_url":"https://unlicense.org/","source_url":"https://github.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db (exercises/Smith_Machine_Bench_Press.json)","author":"free-exercise-db contributors","modified":"split/merged into 3-6 ordered steps; non-instruction sentences removed"}', 0, 'ai_authored:pattern', 0, '["generic_coaching"]', 'library+csv', '2026.10.21-v3', COALESCE((SELECT `created_at` FROM `exercise_library_items` WHERE `id` = '6ef5b34f-8fc4-55b8-b9ec-b99b2282639e'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO `exercise_library_items` (`id`, `ownership`, `trainer_user_id`, `name`, `name_norm`, `name_source`, `description`, `description_provenance`, `instructions`, `primary_muscles_json`, `secondary_muscles_json`, `equipment_json`, `difficulty`, `status`, `slug`, `category_code`, `movement_pattern_code`, `logging_type_code`, `setting`, `mechanic`, `force`, `laterality`, `safety_note`, `source_id`, `source_ref`, `source_name`, `review_status`, `youtube_search_url`, `steps_source`, `steps_licence_json`, `steps_review_required`, `coaching_provenance`, `needs_human_review`, `review_flags_json`, `origin`, `seed_version`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES ('ec7f63a8-25aa-5839-af33-4f8048a611c8', 'global', NULL, 'Smith Machine Bent-Over Row', 'smith machine bent-over row', 'free_exercise_db', 'A compound strength exercise using the machine and a Smith machine that mainly works the upper back, with the biceps and lats assisting.', 'ai_authored:facts_template', '1. Set the barbell attached to the smith machine to a height that is about 2 inches below your knees.
2. Bend your knees slightly and bring your torso forward, by bending at the waist, while keeping the back straight until it is almost parallel to the floor.
3. Now grasp the barbell using an overhand (pronated) grip and unlock it from the smith machine rack. Then let it hang directly in front of you as your arms hang extended perpendicular to the floor and your torso. This is your starting position.
4. While keeping the torso stationary, lift the barbell as you breathe out, keeping the elbows close to the body and not doing any force with the forearm other than holding the weights. On the top contracted position, squeeze the back muscles and hold for a second.
5. Slowly lower the weight again to the starting position as you inhale.
6. Repeat for the recommended amount of repetitions.', '["upper_back"]', '["biceps","lats","front_delts"]', '["machine","smith_machine"]', 'beginner', 'active', 'smith-machine-bent-over-row', 'strength', 'horizontal_pull', 'reps_weight', 'gym', 'compound', 'pull', 'bilateral', 'Keep a neutral spine, especially in bent-over rows.', 'free_exercise_db', 'Smith_Machine_Bent_Over_Row', 'Smith Machine Bent Over Row', 'approve', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Smith+Machine+Bent-Over+Row+exercise+form', 'free_exercise_db', '{"licence":"Unlicense","licence_url":"https://unlicense.org/","source_url":"https://github.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db (exercises/Smith_Machine_Bent_Over_Row.json)","author":"free-exercise-db contributors","modified":"split/merged into 3-6 ordered steps; non-instruction sentences removed"}', 0, 'ai_authored:pattern', 0, '["generic_coaching","no_drawing","no_image"]', 'library', '2026.10.21-v3', COALESCE((SELECT `created_at` FROM `exercise_library_items` WHERE `id` = 'ec7f63a8-25aa-5839-af33-4f8048a611c8'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z');
