2. Initiate the movement by raising one foot off of the ground. Externally rotate the leg and bring the knee toward your elbow, as far forward as possible.
3. Return this leg to the starting position and repeat on the opposite side.', '["abs"]', '["chest","front_delts","triceps"]', '["bodyweight"]', 'beginner', 'active', 'spider-crawl', 'strength', 'core_anti_extension', 'reps_bodyweight', 'home', 'compound', 'pull', 'bilateral', 'Stop when form breaks rather than chasing time.', 'free_exercise_db', 'Spider_Crawl', 'Spider Crawl', 'needs_human', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Spider+Crawl+exercise+form', 'free_exercise_db', '{"licence":"Unlicense","licence_url":"https://unlicense.org/","source_url":"https://github.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db (exercises/Spider_Crawl.json)","author":"free-exercise-db contributors","modified":"split/merged into 3-6 ordered steps; non-instruction sentences removed"}', 0, 'ai_authored:pattern', 1, '["csv_disagrees","generic_coaching","no_drawing","no_image"]', 'library+csv', '2026.10.21-v3', COALESCE((SELECT `created_at` FROM `exercise_library_items` WHERE `id` = '9a031b91-d55c-5bd4-8976-be8f1687d3ad'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z');
