2. Hold the EZ bar with your arms straight.
3. Curl the EZ bar toward your shoulders, keeping your elbows still.
4. Squeeze your biceps at the top.
5. Lower the EZ bar slowly until your arms are straight.', '["biceps"]', '[]', '["ez_bar"]', 'beginner', 'active', 'spider-curl', 'strength', 'elbow_flexion', 'reps_weight', 'gym', 'isolation', 'pull', 'bilateral', 'Use a load you can control for the whole set.', 'free_exercise_db', 'Spider_Curl', 'Spider Curl', 'approve', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Spider+Curl+exercise+form', 'fitbud_written', '{"licence":"FitBud proprietary (own wording)","author":"FitBud","replaces":"free_exercise_db"}', 1, 'ai_authored:pattern', 1, '["generic_coaching","steps_fitbud_written_trainer_review"]', 'library+csv', '2026.10.21-v3', COALESCE((SELECT `created_at` FROM `exercise_library_items` WHERE `id` = 'ca4f00c3-2aa2-504f-8f18-737a37cff27a'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z');
