2. Round your upper back and push your hands away, spreading your shoulder blades apart.
3. Stop at a gentle stretch in your upper back and hold for 20-30 seconds, breathing slowly.
4. Release slowly and repeat if needed.', '["upper_back"]', '["lats","lower_back","neck","traps"]', '["bodyweight"]', 'beginner', 'active', 'spinal-stretch', 'mobility', 'mobility', 'time_hold', 'mobility', 'isolation', 'static', 'bilateral', 'Mild tension is fine; sharp pain is not.', 'free_exercise_db', 'Spinal_Stretch', 'Spinal Stretch', 'approve', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Spinal+Stretch+exercise+form', 'fitbud_written', '{"licence":"FitBud proprietary (own wording)","author":"FitBud","replaces":"free_exercise_db"}', 1, 'ai_authored:pattern', 1, '["generic_coaching","no_drawing","no_image","steps_fitbud_written_trainer_review"]', 'library', '2026.10.21-v3', COALESCE((SELECT `created_at` FROM `exercise_library_items` WHERE `id` = 'a552203e-9d22-5480-a5df-a8e3c048c7bf'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z');
