2. Simultaneously raise your arms, legs, and chest off of the floor and hold this contraction for 2 seconds. Remember to exhale during this movement.
3. Slowly begin to lower your arms, legs and chest back down to the starting position while inhaling.
4. Repeat for the recommended amount of repetitions prescribed in your program.', '["lower_back"]', '["glutes","hamstrings"]', '["bodyweight"]', 'beginner', 'active', 'superman', 'mobility', 'hinge', 'time_hold', 'home', 'compound', 'static', 'bilateral', 'Start light; stop if you feel sharp lower-back pain.', 'free_exercise_db', 'Superman', 'Superman', 'needs_human', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Superman+exercise+form', 'free_exercise_db', '{"licence":"Unlicense","licence_url":"https://unlicense.org/","source_url":"https://github.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db (exercises/Superman.json)","author":"free-exercise-db contributors","modified":"split/merged into 3-6 ordered steps; non-instruction sentences removed"}', 0, 'ai_authored:pattern', 1, '["csv_disagrees","generic_coaching"]', 'library+csv', '2026.10.21-v3', COALESCE((SELECT `created_at` FROM `exercise_library_items` WHERE `id` = '4ae66d20-e2c8-52c5-a8b5-d651770a9896'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z');
