2. Slowly press against the machine with your legs to move them away from each other while exhaling.
3. Feel the contraction for a second and begin to move your legs back to the starting position while breathing in.
4. Repeat for the recommended amount of repetitions.', '["abductors"]', '["glutes"]', '["machine"]', 'beginner', 'active', 'thigh-abductor', 'strength', 'hip_abduction_adduction', 'reps_weight', 'gym', 'isolation', 'push', 'bilateral', 'Stay within a pain-free range.', 'free_exercise_db', 'Thigh_Abductor', 'Thigh Abductor', 'approve', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Thigh+Abductor+exercise+form', 'free_exercise_db', '{"licence":"Unlicense","licence_url":"https://unlicense.org/","source_url":"https://github.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db (exercises/Thigh_Abductor.json)","author":"free-exercise-db contributors","modified":"split/merged into 3-6 ordered steps; non-instruction sentences removed"}', 0, 'ai_authored:pattern', 0, '["generic_coaching"]', 'library', '2026.10.21-v3', COALESCE((SELECT `created_at` FROM `exercise_library_items` WHERE `id` = 'da098264-88b4-5d3c-88f3-00ad2329fe51'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z');
