2. Begin by quickly raising one knee as high as you can. Do not swing your body or your legs. 3.
3. Immediately reverse the motion, returning that leg to the starting position. Simultaneously raise the opposite knee as high as possible.
4. Continue alternating between legs until the set is complete.', '["abs"]', '[]', '["bodyweight"]', 'beginner', 'active', 'wind-sprints', 'cardio', 'locomotion', 'time', 'cardio', 'compound', 'pull', 'bilateral', 'Stop if you feel chest pain, dizziness or unusual breathlessness.', 'free_exercise_db', 'Wind_Sprints', 'Wind Sprints', 'approve_with_flags', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Wind+Sprints+exercise+form', 'free_exercise_db', '{"licence":"Unlicense","licence_url":"https://unlicense.org/","source_url":"https://github.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db (exercises/Wind_Sprints.json)","author":"free-exercise-db contributors","modified":"split/merged into 3-6 ordered steps; non-instruction sentences removed; curated edit to pass step validation (curation/steps_source_fixes.tsv)"}', 0, 'ai_authored:pattern', 1, '["generic_coaching","no_alternative","no_drawing","no_image","no_relations"]', 'library', '2026.10.21-v3', COALESCE((SELECT `created_at` FROM `exercise_library_items` WHERE `id` = 'cee72a99-7d0c-572b-933c-2baa8847511a'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z');
