2. Now, place the arm on the same side as your front leg on the ground, with the elbow next to the foot. Your other hand should be placed on the ground, parallel to your lead leg, to help support you during this portion of the stretch.
3. After 10-20 seconds, place your hands on either side of your front foot. Raise the toes of the front foot off of the ground, and straighten your leg. You may need to reposition your rear leg to do so. Hold for 10-20 seconds, and then repeat the entire sequence for the other side.', '["hamstrings"]', '["calves","glutes","quads"]', '["bodyweight"]', 'intermediate', 'active', 'world-s-greatest-stretch', 'mobility', 'mobility', 'time_hold', 'mobility', 'compound', 'static', 'bilateral', 'Mild tension is fine; sharp pain is not.', 'free_exercise_db', 'Worlds_Greatest_Stretch', 'World''s Greatest Stretch', 'approve', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=World%27s+Greatest+Stretch+exercise+form', 'free_exercise_db', '{"licence":"Unlicense","licence_url":"https://unlicense.org/","source_url":"https://github.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db (exercises/Worlds_Greatest_Stretch.json)","author":"free-exercise-db contributors","modified":"split/merged into 3-6 ordered steps; non-instruction sentences removed"}', 0, 'ai_authored:pattern', 0, '["generic_coaching","no_drawing","no_image"]', 'library', '2026.10.21-v3', COALESCE((SELECT `created_at` FROM `exercise_library_items` WHERE `id` = '60b23cc2-9ca7-52a4-8655-9ccb69098ccd'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z');
