2. Swing your arms back as you dip into a quarter squat.
3. Jump up onto the box taking off from one foot and landing on both.
4. Land softly on both feet in the middle of the box with your knees bent.
5. Stand tall, then step down one foot at a time.
6. Switch legs on each rep.', '["quads"]', '["abs","adductors","calves","glutes","hamstrings","hip_flexors"]', '["plyo_box"]', 'beginner', 'active', '1-to-2-box-jump', 'plyometric', 'plyometric', 'reps_bodyweight', 'home', 'compound', 'push', 'bilateral', 'Use a forgiving surface; skip with knee/ankle pain.', 'user_csv', 'user_exercises.csv:15', '1 to 2 Box Jump', 'approve_with_flags', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=1+to+2+Box+Jump+exercise+form', 'fitbud_written', '{"licence":"FitBud proprietary (own wording)","author":"FitBud"}', 1, 'ai_derived:pattern', 1, '["no_drawing","steps_fitbud_written_trainer_review"]', 'csv', '2026.10.21-v3', COALESCE((SELECT `created_at` FROM `exercise_library_items` WHERE `id` = '4316ecf5-07ba-5cf6-9cbb-87f22e198e89'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z');
