2. Now bend at the knees and place your outer thighs by the floor (or mat) as you make the soles of your feet touch each other.
3. Now try pushing both soles and bringing them up as near you as possible while you keep the outer thighs on the floor (or at least almost touching it). Now, cross your arms in front of you by touching the opposite shoulders. This will be your starting position.
4. As you exhale flatten your lower back to the floor while curling the torso upwards. Hold at the top position for a second.
5. As you inhale, slowly lower back to the starting position.
6. Repeat for the recommended amount of repetitions.', '["abs"]', '[]', '["bodyweight"]', 'beginner', 'active', 'frog-sit-up', 'strength', 'core_flexion', 'reps_bodyweight', 'home', 'isolation', 'pull', 'bilateral', 'Skip or modify if it aggravates lower-back pain.', 'user_csv', 'user_exercises.csv:414', 'Frog Sit Up', 'approve', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Frog+Sit-up+exercise+form', 'free_exercise_db', '{"licence":"Unlicense","licence_url":"https://unlicense.org/","source_url":"https://github.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db (exercises/Frog_Sit-Ups.json)","author":"free-exercise-db contributors","modified":"split/merged into 3-6 ordered steps; non-instruction sentences removed"}', 0, 'ai_derived:pattern', 0, '["no_drawing"]', 'csv', '2026.10.21-v3', COALESCE((SELECT `created_at` FROM `exercise_library_items` WHERE `id` = '2820dc4e-f440-58d2-8983-fd5953742798'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z');
