2. As you breathe in, come down slowly until you feel the bar on your middle chest.
3. After a second pause, bring the bar back to the starting position as you breathe out and push the bar using your triceps muscles. Lock your arms in the contracted position, hold for a second and then start coming down slowly again.
4. Repeat the movement for the prescribed amount of repetitions.
5. When you are done, lock the bar back in the rack.', '["triceps"]', '["chest","shoulders"]', '["smith_machine"]', 'beginner', 'active', 'smith-machine-close-grip-bench-press', 'strength', 'horizontal_push', 'reps_weight', 'gym', 'compound', 'push', 'bilateral', 'Use a spotter or safety arms for heavy pressing.', 'user_csv', 'user_exercises.csv:975', 'Smith Machine Close Grip Bench Press', 'approve', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Smith+Machine+Close-Grip+Bench+Press+exercise+form', 'free_exercise_db', '{"licence":"Unlicense","licence_url":"https://unlicense.org/","source_url":"https://github.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db (exercises/Smith_Machine_Close-Grip_Bench_Press.json)","author":"free-exercise-db contributors","modified":"split/merged into 3-6 ordered steps; non-instruction sentences removed"}', 0, 'ai_derived:pattern', 0, '[]', 'csv', '2026.10.21-v3', COALESCE((SELECT `created_at` FROM `exercise_library_items` WHERE `id` = 'a05f87e6-b02d-51ee-9b5d-209cd80b43b4'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z');
