2. Grip the bar with your hands clearly wider than shoulder-width, set your shoulder blades back and down, and unhook it to straight arms over your shoulders.
3. Lower the bar under control to your mid chest, elbows at about 45-70 degrees from your body.
4. Press the bar back up to straight arms, keeping your feet planted and your upper back tight.
5. Rack the bar carefully when the set is done.', '["chest"]', '["shoulders","triceps"]', '["smith_machine"]', 'beginner', 'active', 'smith-machine-wide-grip-bench-press', 'strength', 'horizontal_push', 'reps_weight', 'gym', 'compound', 'push', 'bilateral', 'Use a spotter or safety arms for heavy pressing.', 'user_csv', 'user_exercises.csv:993', 'Smith Machine Wide Grip Bench Press', 'approve_with_flags', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Smith+Machine+Wide-Grip+Bench+Press+exercise+form', 'fitbud_written', '{"licence":"FitBud proprietary (own wording)","author":"FitBud"}', 1, 'ai_derived:pattern', 1, '["media_variant_drawing","steps_fitbud_written_trainer_review"]', 'csv', '2026.10.21-v3', COALESCE((SELECT `created_at` FROM `exercise_library_items` WHERE `id` = '83071d6e-5d91-5e76-988e-6c61e3e9f479'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z');
