2. While holding the upper arms stationary, curl the weights forward while contracting the biceps as you breathe out.
3. Continue the movement until your biceps are fully contracted and the bar is at shoulder level. Hold the contracted position for a second and squeeze the biceps hard.
4. Slowly begin to bring the bar back to starting position as your breathe in.
5. Repeat for the recommended amount of repetitions.', '["biceps"]', '[]', '["barbell"]', 'beginner', 'active', 'wide-grip-standing-barbell-curl', 'strength', 'elbow_flexion', 'reps_weight', 'gym', 'isolation', 'pull', 'bilateral', 'Use a load you can control for the whole set.', 'user_csv', 'user_exercises.csv:1175', 'Wide Grip Standing Barbell Curl', 'approve', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Wide-Grip+Standing+Barbell+Curl+exercise+form', 'free_exercise_db', '{"licence":"Unlicense","licence_url":"https://unlicense.org/","source_url":"https://github.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db (exercises/Wide-Grip_Standing_Barbell_Curl.json)","author":"free-exercise-db contributors","modified":"split/merged into 3-6 ordered steps; non-instruction sentences removed"}', 0, 'ai_derived:pattern', 0, '[]', 'csv', '2026.10.21-v3', COALESCE((SELECT `created_at` FROM `exercise_library_items` WHERE `id` = 'eb5cdf0e-1644-5061-af00-b9253dc77346'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z');
