2. Hold the barbell at shoulder height.
3. Press the barbell straight overhead without leaning back.
4. Lower the barbell back to your shoulder under control.', '["shoulders"]', '["traps","triceps"]', '["barbell"]', 'intermediate', 'active', 'z-press', 'strength', 'vertical_push', 'reps_weight', 'gym', 'compound', 'push', 'bilateral', 'Avoid if overhead pressing causes shoulder pain; use a landmine press instead.', 'user_csv', 'user_exercises.csv:1187', 'Z Press', 'approve_with_flags', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Z+Press+exercise+form', 'fitbud_written', '{"licence":"FitBud proprietary (own wording)","author":"FitBud"}', 1, 'ai_derived:pattern', 1, '["no_drawing","steps_fitbud_written_trainer_review"]', 'csv', '2026.10.21-v3', COALESCE((SELECT `created_at` FROM `exercise_library_items` WHERE `id` = '15a12629-ef72-5e01-8ed3-2f4148eaa94e'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z'), '2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z');
